invariant: INV-14
file: srv_tcp_nonblocking.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: ch_srv_record_init reads no instant from the caller's clock, so the
  session's instant stays 0, and the server issues no ticket and accepts
  none. A full handshake still completes, so only resumption notices:
  test/tcp_nonblocking_resume_tests.h requires a ticket after the full
  handshake, and objects.

--- old
    r->t.now_seconds = cfg_clock_read(cfg); // the instant every ticket rule reads
--- new
